The prebuilt kernel, DTB, DTBO, and stock vendor ramdisk under prebuilt/,
and the Trustonic/MediaTek/TCL binaries, shared libraries, Trusted
Applications (mcRegistry), and VINTF fragments under recovery/root/vendor/
are proprietary TCL, MediaTek, Trustonic and/or Google files extracted
from stock 8189S (selene_vzw, 4PEN) firmware. They are included only so
this TWRP tree can be reproduced and are not licensed under Apache-2.0.
